Body:
packages/opencode/src/tool/webfetch.ts, line 20:
remove `.pipe(Schema.optional, Schema.withDecodingDefault(Effect.succeed("markdown" as const))),`

Should look like this:

```ts
export const Parameters = Schema.Struct({
  url: Schema.String.annotate({ description: "The URL to fetch content from" }),
  format: Schema.Literals(["text", "markdown", "html"])
    .annotate({
      description: "The format to return the content in (text, markdown, or html). Defaults to markdown.",
      default: "markdown",
    }),
  timeout: Schema.optional(Schema.Number).annotate({ description: "Optional timeout in seconds (max 120)" }),
})
```

<img width="801" height="523" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f2a7774-3c29-4fb6-b7d0-c7fcc8b0c270" />

The original version sends this schema.format:
```json
      "format": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "markdown",
              "html"
            ],
            "description": "The format to return the content in (text, markdown, or html). Defaults to markdown.",
            "default": "markdown"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ]
      }
```

Fixed:
```json
      "format": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "text",
          "markdown",
          "html"
        ],
        "description": "The format to return the content in (text, markdown, or html). Defaults to markdown.",
        "default": "markdown"
      }
```

Not sure what exactly is wrong, though.

